{
    "_doc": "Condom commands (Docs/Interactions/Step06FPermissionsImplementationPlan.md, P5b; split per Docs/Interactions/Plan_UseItemFolders.md) - COM_EquipSingleUseItem, one fixed targeting each, all listed under the condom's 使用 folder (itemFolder). self: the doer on themselves, receivers ignored (selfOnly); onTarget: the doer on the receiver; byTarget: the receiver on the doer (wearerIsDoer), so the receiver's acceptance and skill decide. No 'sex' tag: allowedDuringSex makes them usable inside sex scenes and outside (e.g. a pre-sex intimate scene). service + unsafe like the hand / oral acts they mirror (ActionPackage_Sex: rolled and stimulating); permission_intimacy_high asks for the high intimacy tier explicitly on the two-person commands. remove commands take a worn condom off (used condom on the floor); the others put one on from an accessible inventory (same per-actor search as requireInventory). The self commands have no DC (baseD20Check 0); the mouth commands have a higher DC; a failed DC still stimulates but equips and uses up nothing.",
